    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present this well-appointed and modern 3 bed first floor duplex, located in the convenient development of Ballyowen Hall within easy access to every possible convenience from excellent transport to excellent shopping from Ballyowen Shopping Centre to Liffey Valley.\nNo 50 is a fine duplex, beautifully presented and offers excellent accommodation over two floors. The apartment is sure to capture the interest of first-time buyers, investors and people trading up/down alike. \nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall with guest WC tucked under the stairs, a large kitchen/dining area to the front overlooking the well maintained communal area. The living room to the rear has been decorated in style, creating a lovely space to entertain your guests. With sliding patio doors providing access to a spacious balcony. \nUpstairs there are 3 bedrooms, 2 doubles (with main en-suite), 1 single, and the family bathroom.\nThe main features of this beautiful apartment is: Feature fireplace in the living room, new laminate flooring throughout the property and fitted wardrobes in all three bedrooms.\nThe property further boast: double glazed windows, gas central heating, underground and off street level parking.\nThe property is located within a private and well-maintained grounds where parking for both residents and visitors is freely available. The property also offers easy access to an excellent road network with the ring road on your doorstep ensuring should you wish to avail of the N7 or N4 can be done with ease and convenience. Ballyowen Park is across the road and will provide a great space for the stroll or the more energetic a jog. \nRecently renovated by it's current owners the property has all the right ingredients to for the perfect home within the perfect location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.12m x 5.33m\nnew wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.05m x 5.09m\nLocated to the front of the property, is a spacious kitchen/dining area with multiple storage units at floor and eye level.\n\nLiving Room - 3.08m x 5.13m\nLocated to the rear of the property, is a spacious living room complete with laminate flooring, feature fireplace and access to a spacious balcony.\n\nW/C - 0.76m x 1.80m\nComplete with tiled flooring, wc and whb.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.01m x 3.52m\nLarge double bed with new laminate flooring, fitted wardrobe and an ensuite.\n\nEn-Suite - 0.89m x 2.29m\nComplete with tiled flooring, wc, whb and shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.73m x 2.52m\nAnother large double bed with new laminate flooring and fitted wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.42m x 2.52m\nA spacious single bedroom also fitted with new laminate flooring and fitted wardrobe.\n\nLanding - 2.50m x 5.47m\nFitted with new laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom - 2.03m x 1.95m\nComplete with black tilled flooring, wc, whb and bath/shower unit.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 Bed duplex in walk-in condition </li><li>G.F.C.H</li><li>Secure and Gated Development</li><li>Private balcony </li><li>Landscaped Communal Gardens </li><li>Ample street level and underground car parking</li><li>Secured Bike Shed</ul>"
      },
